### 5 — Decorator order test A: Encryption first
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userType": 0,
  "format": 2,
  "channel": 2,
  "enhancements": ["Encryption", "Header"],
  "recipientEmail": "",
  "sharedFolderPath": "",
  "requestingUserId": "user-order-test"
}

###

### 5b — Decorator order test B: Header first (appliedEnhancements order differs from 5a)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userType": 0,
  "format": 2,
  "channel": 2,
  "enhancements": ["Header", "Encryption"],
  "recipientEmail": "",
  "sharedFolderPath": "",
  "requestingUserId": "user-order-test"
}
